/P 203 0 R
/E (Following up on my previous post where I delivered a Toyota Hilux to Kramatorsk, Ukraine, here's my report on the two nights I spent there \(previously posted as an article on twitter\):)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12 523 0 R 14 524 0 R 16]
>>
endobj
