477 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 204 0 R
/T (Laugh all you want. But hygiene is critical; every soldier I meet who has actually been in the field absolute loves wet wipes. Heck, with one of the trucks I've delivered, we included about $300 worth of them. ...)
